title: "wimse-http-signature-test-vectors"
abstract: >-
  Machine-readable test vectors (6 positive, 23 negative) for the WIMSE
  workload-to-workload HTTP Message Signature profile
  (draft-ietf-wimse-http-signature-08, RFC 9421), with extraction log and
  schema validator.
